      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Qliph-Scarred.</strong> You walked out of a place that should have unmade you. The hollows and fractures in your soul never fully closed, and the world can feel the pressure leaking out.</p><hr><p><em><strong>Qliph-Scarred Traits</strong></em></p><ul><li><p><strong>Creature Type.</strong> Humanoid (Qliph-Scarred).</p></li><li><p><strong>Size.</strong> You are Medium.</p></li><li><p><strong>Speed.</strong> Your walking speed is 6 squares</p></li><li><p><strong>attributes.</strong> Your background determines your attribute increases; Qliph-Scarred does not grant any attribute bonuses.</p></li></ul><p>Your Qliph-Scarred heritage grants you additional features through advancements (Item Grants) added during character creation.</p>",
